<h2 data-sweep>THE HOLY TRINITY OF MUSHROOMS</h2>
<p>We launched with these three mushrooms, each extracted for max absorption, because we believe them to be the holy trinity of mycological research. Turkey tail for the crowded airport and the long flight. Lion's mane for when you need to <span class="rcx-ob">mentally lock in</span>. Cordyceps for the early start and the long day. Built for an ever&#8209;changing world that won't slow&nbsp;down.</p>
